Take your iPod on the road while keeping it fully charged! This charger connects your iPod to your car's, RV, or boat's power source and providing you with unlimited music playback!

General Features: 
- Charges your iPod through cigarette lighter outlet in your car, RV, or boat; 
- Integrated FireWire port; 
- Connects your iPod with existing firewire cable; 
- Input: DC 12V, 24V; 
- Output:DC 11 - 23V, 1000mA maximum; 
- LED power indicator; 
- Compact design. 

Requirements: 
- Available cigarette lighter; 
- FireWire sync cable for iPod. 

Fits MODELS:
- IPOD 1Gen (1 Generation); 
- IPOD 2Gen (2 Generation).

Emer vacuums have been known worldwide for their superior suction power and 
efficiency, and for industrial or commercial settings, the Leonardo 902300U dry 
commercial drum vacuum cleaner doesn't disappoint.

The 9020300U Leonardo boasts a powerful 1300 watt motor with 
an impressive 92 inch water lift, as well 85 CFM and a large 8 gallon anti-shock 
plastic drum. The blower function lets you move significant amounts of debris at 
once, and with an operating radius of 32 feet, the Leonardo is ideal for 
vacuuming large areas with ease. Other features include a flexible hose, plastic 
extension tube, carpet/floor nozzle, upholstery tool, crevice tool, and even a 
carry handle for easy maneuverability. 

However, the Emer 9020300U Leonardo also includes advanced features that are 
exclusive to this particular model, particularly the direct connect system with 
on/off switch that allows you to switch from bare floors to carpets and back 
with ease; the quick foot release that prevents bending and straining; and a 
telescopic wand that adjusts to your preferred height. As well, the deluxe WPN 
brush utilizes a geared belt drive system and a patented motor protection 
integrated circuit that detects any problems in the brush before damage 
occurs, and it will then automatically shut off power to the nozzle. 

Specifications:
Has a large operating radius of 32 feet;
Item Number: 9020300U;
Model: Leonardo Dry;
Design and Color: Drum (Blue);
Dirt Capture: Bag/Bagless;
Tank/Bag Capacity: 8 gallons;
Motor Amperage: 11 Amps;
Consumed Power: 1300 Watts;
Speeds: 1;
Water Lift: 85 inches;
Airflow: 67 CFM;
Number of Tools: 3;
Convenience: Lightweight/heavy-duty;
Cord/Reach: 42 feet;
Tank: Anti-shock plastic;
Cartridge Filter: Yes;
Hose Rotating: Yes;
Blower Function: Yes;
Filtration: Foam (HEPA optional);
Detachable Cord: N/A>;
Electric Power Brush: Optional;
Turbo Nozzle: Optional;
Aircraft Conversion: Yes;
Motor Warranty: 1 year;
Parts and Labor: 1 year.

